flowchart TD
    New[thread/start] --> Live[Live session\none active normal turn]
    Live --> Turn[Turns contain durable items\nmessage, tool call, result]
    Turn --> Rollout[Append-oriented rollout records]
    Rollout -. project/index .-> Store[Thread store]
    Live --> Interrupt[Interrupt or process stop]
    Interrupt --> Rollout
    Rollout --> Closed[Persisted / unloaded thread]
    Store --> Closed
    Closed --> Resume[thread/resume]
    Resume --> Reconstruct[Read rollout/store\nnormalize + rebuild initial history]
    Reconstruct --> NewLive[New live session]
    NewLive --> Live
    Live --> Flush[Flush recorded history]
    Flush --> Fork[thread/fork snapshot]
    Fork --> Child[New thread identity]
    Child --> NewLive
    Closed --> Archive[Archive or delete metadata]
